<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Klipton cautions it in talks.</title>
<headline>Klipton cautions it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klipton Ltd said on Monday it was still in talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement. The company first announced it was in negtiations on December 12.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
